/**
 * Service Worker registration shim
 * The actual SW is generated by vite-plugin-pwa (workbox).
 * This file is referenced here for documentation purposes only.
 *
 * Registration flow (handled by vite-plugin-pwa autoUpdate mode):
 * 1. On first load: SW installs, caches all static assets
 * 2. On subsequent loads: SW serves from cache (offline-first)
 * 3. On new deployment: SW detects update, skipWaiting() activates immediately
 * 4. Clients.claim() takes control of all open tabs without reload
 *
 * Cache strategy: CacheFirst for static assets (JS, CSS, HTML, SVG)
 * No runtime caching — zero network dependencies by design.
 *
 * The generated sw.js will be at /pickleball-pwa/sw.js after build.
 */
